1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,813
As Uke comes to grab your wrist with both hands

2
00:00:02,814 --> 00:00:04,224
extend towards him

3
00:00:04,225 --> 00:00:05,121
as he holds

4
00:00:05,122 --> 00:00:06,091
using his momentum

5
00:00:06,092 --> 00:00:07,964
lead him around in a big circular movement

6
00:00:08,265 --> 00:00:10,223
controlling his fingers and his wrist

7
00:00:10,524 --> 00:00:12,177
bring towards your center

8
00:00:12,478 --> 00:00:15,278
keeping the space open take a large step to his side

9
00:00:15,279 --> 00:00:17,032
and bring him around for the pin

10
00:00:18,033 --> 00:00:19,549
as you do so sit down

11
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,675
controlling his shoulder

12
00:00:20,976 --> 00:00:23,142
placing his shoulder in between your knees

13
00:00:23,143 --> 00:00:25,121
controlling his wrist with the opposite arm,

14
00:00:25,122 --> 00:00:26,229
bring it to your body

15
00:00:26,230 --> 00:00:28,725
and turn your body towards his head for the pin.

